  "notes": "\"(R)\" plant code under copyrights on labels and serifed \"I\" stamped in runouts denote [l=RCA Records Pressing Plant, Indianapolis], pressing. Remainder of runouts mostly etched, mastering and plating letters stamped.\n\nIssued with printed inner sleeve with credits and tracklist.\n\nCatalog number SP 70604 on back cover.\nCatalog number SP-70604 on labels.\nCatalog number SP70604 on spine, inner sleeve.\n\nHype sticker, with catalog number SP70604:\nR.E.M.\ncontains: Radio Free Europe & Talk About The Passion\n$6.98 list\n© 1983 I.R.S., Inc. Printed in USA\n\nRecorded January 83\nProduction, Engineering at: Reflection, Charlotte, NC\nMastered: At Sterling Sound\nAll selections published by Night Garden Music (BMI). Administered throughout the Universe by Unichappell Music, Inc. (BMI)\n℗ 1983 I.R.S., Inc. © 1983 I.R.S., Inc. © 1983 International Records Syndicate Inc.\n",
